@startuml SEQ_11_KALENDER_KEGIATAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-11: Melihat Kalender Kegiatan

actor       "Admin / Asisten / Kadep" as User
boundary    "KalenderPage"            as Page
control     "KegiatanController"      as Ctrl
entity      "Kegiatan"                as ModelKegiatan
entity      "TahunKepengurusan"       as ModelTahun
entity      "KepengurusanLab"         as ModelKepLab
database    "kegiatan"                as DB

note over Page, Ctrl
  Middleware: auth
  Semua role dengan akses kegiatan bisa melihat kalender
  Warna event: diajukan = kuning (#f59e0b), disetujui = biru (#3b82f6)
end note

== Skenario A: Buka Halaman Kalender ==

User -> Page  : Buka /kegiatan/kalender
Page  -> Ctrl : GET /kegiatan/kalender
Ctrl --> Page  : Inertia::render('Kegiatan/Kalender')
Page --> User  : Tampil komponen kalender FullCalendar\n(awalnya kosong, siap fetch events)

== Skenario B: Fetch Data Events Kalender ==

Page  -> Ctrl : GET /kegiatan/calendar-data\n  ?kepengurusan_lab_id={id}
Ctrl  -> Ctrl  : resolve kepengurusan_lab_id\n  dari Auth user atau request param

note right of Ctrl
  Jika user non-all_access:
    gunakan user.kepengurusan_lab_id
  Jika all_access + ada lab_id param:
    cari KepengurusanLab by lab_id + tahun aktif
end note

alt kepengurusan_lab_id tidak dikenal & butuh resolve via lab_id
  Ctrl  -> ModelTahun : where(isactive, true).first()
  ModelTahun -> DB : SELECT tahun_kepengurusan WHERE isactive
  DB   --> ModelTahun : row
  Ctrl  -> ModelKepLab : where(lab_id)\n.where(tahun_kepengurusan_id).first()
  ModelKepLab -> DB : SELECT kepengurusan_lab
  DB   --> ModelKepLab : row
end

Ctrl  -> ModelKegiatan : whereIn(status_approval,\n  ['diajukan','disetujui'])\n.whereHas(proker.kepengurusan_lab_id)\n.get()
ModelKegiatan -> DB : SELECT kegiatan WHERE status_approval IN (...)
DB   --> ModelKegiatan : rows

Ctrl  -> Ctrl  : Map ke format FullCalendar:\n  {id, title, start, end,\n   url: route(kegiatan.show),\n   backgroundColor: warna per status,\n   status}
Ctrl --> Page  : JSON array events
Page  -> Page  : FullCalendar.addEventSource(events)
Page --> User  : Tampil event-event kegiatan di kalender

== Skenario C: Klik Event di Kalender ==

User -> Page  : Klik salah satu event
Page  -> Page  : Event memiliki 'url' → navigate ke\n  /kegiatan/{id} (show page)
Page --> User  : Redirect ke halaman detail kegiatan

@enduml
